# Agent Rules for this Project

## SonarQube Analysis
- We use a local SonarQube instance for code quality. 
- ALWAYS use the `sonarqube` MCP server tools to check for issues before marking a task as "done."
- If I ask to "fix bugs," start by calling `get_sonar_issues` to see what needs work.

## Production Monitoring (Railway)
- Our production environment is on Railway.
- Use the `railway` MCP server to fetch logs or check service status.
- NEVER guess the status of production; use the `get-logs` tool from the MCP server.